| 8 | Trigger | kill | 3 | 25 | Parametrix already runs the cloud-outage cat bond and calculation agent and extended monitoring to ChatGPT, Gemini and Claude in 2024 ([Parametrix](https://www.parametrixinsurance.com/in-the-news/parametrix-expands-monitoring-capabilities-to-ai-services-like-chatgpt)); the whole cloud-outage cat bond is $35M ([Artemis](https://www.artemis.bm/deal-directory/cumulus-re-series-2026-1/)); all cyber cat bonds ~ $0.8B at end 2024 ([Geneva Association](https://www.genevaassociation.org/sites/default/files/2026-08/cyber_ils_summary_120826.pdf)) vs the idea's $5B referenced limit |

